ELIFS
An elif is used in an if-statement. It means if-else. You can use it if you want to have multiple outcomes of an if. Example:

if name == "Sunny":
    print("That's my name too!")
elif name == "Olivia":
    print("Whoa! That's my friend's name!")
else:
    print("That's a nice name!")


